---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Breadcrumb from "../components/Breadcrumb.astro";
---

<Layout title="RFID" description="RFID access pass guidelines, application process, and downloadable forms for vehicles entering Subic Bay Gateway Park.">
  <section class="bg-primary-500 py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="mb-4 inline-block border border-white/20 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-white/70">RFID Access</div>
      <h1 class="mb-4 text-5xl font-extrabold text-white md:text-6xl">RFID Guidelines</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-white/70">RFID access and guidelines for vehicles entering Subic Bay Gateway Park</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Breadcrumb pages={[{ label: "Products & Services", href: "/rfid" }, { label: "RFID Access" }]} />

  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up">RFID Information</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up">
          <button class="faq-toggle flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left">
            <span class="pr-4 font-semibold text-primary-500">Where to install the RFID?</span>
            <svg class="faq-icon h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary-500 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4" /></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-4">
              <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-600">RFID must be installed by the authorized SBDMC personnel on the non-metal part of the vehicle (headlight, fairings, visor).</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="50">
          <button class="faq-toggle flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left">
            <span class="pr-4 font-semibold text-primary-500">How long is the validity of the RFID?</span>
            <svg class="faq-icon h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary-500 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4" /></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-4">
              <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-600">SBGP RFID is valid only for <strong>one (1) year</strong> from the date of issuance/registration.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <button class="faq-toggle flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left">
            <span class="pr-4 font-semibold text-primary-500">How do I keep my RFID in great condition?</span>
            <svg class="faq-icon h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary-500 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4" /></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-4">
              <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-gray-600">
                <li>Do not put excessive force on the black chip at the middle part of the RFID.</li>
                <li>Do not peel it off and transfer in other location or vehicle.</li>
                <li>Do not spray directly with pressure washer during car wash.</li>
                <li>Do not wipe abrasive substance on the sticker.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
          <button class="faq-toggle flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left">
            <span class="pr-4 font-semibold text-primary-500">Is there a replacement fee for the RFID?</span>
            <svg class="faq-icon h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary-500 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4" /></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-4">
              <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-600">The warranty will be void if the RFID is unmounted, lost, transferred, or damaged due to mishandling or removal. There is a replacement fee of <strong>PhP 300.00</strong> for lost or damaged RFID.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
          <button class="faq-toggle flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left">
            <span class="pr-4 font-semibold text-primary-500">What vehicles are required to have RFID?</span>
            <svg class="faq-icon h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary-500 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4" /></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-4">
              <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-600">All vehicles entering and exiting SBGP are required to have a valid RFID sticker, including cars, motorcycles, trucks, and other motor vehicles. This applies to locators, employees, tenants, and visitors.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="250">
          <button class="faq-toggle flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left">
            <span class="pr-4 font-semibold text-primary-500">What happens if my RFID doesn't scan at the gate?</span>
            <svg class="faq-icon h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary-500 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4" /></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-4">
              <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-600">If your RFID fails to scan, proceed to the guard house for manual verification. Security personnel will assist you. If the RFID is damaged or defective, you may need to apply for a replacement at the SBDMC office.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-500">RFID Fees</h2>
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-gray-200">
          <table class="w-full text-left">
            <thead class="bg-gray-50">
              <tr>
                <th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-600">Category</th>
                <th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-600">Fee</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-200">
              <tr>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">Gatepassers</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-primary-500">PHP 1,000.00</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">SBGP Employees</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-primary-500">PHP 300.00</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-500">RFID Gate Locations</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-600">RFID checkpoints are installed at <strong>all entry and exit gates</strong> of Subic Bay Gateway Park.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up">RFID Usage Guidelines</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="card border-l-4 border-yellow-500" data-aos="fade-up">
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-yellow-500 text-white">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold text-yellow-600">Avoid Tailgating</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Maintain distance. Keep <strong>one (1) car length</strong> between your vehicle and the next one.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-l-4 border-blue-500" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="50">
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-500 text-white">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold text-blue-600">Wait Your Turn</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Barrier closes after each vehicle. Wait until the vehicle ahead has fully passed the barrier gate and the boom arm has lowered down before you proceed.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-l-4 border-red-500" data-aos="fade-up">
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-red-500 text-white">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold text-red-600">RFID Blocking</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">SBDMC has the right to block/confiscate RFID access of vehicles of companies/SBGP Locators found to have violations under their lease agreements with SBDMC, and other users who violated proper usage of RFID sticker or any SBGP rules and regulations.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-l-4 border-purple-500" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="50">
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-purple-500 text-white">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold text-purple-600">Non-Transferable</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">RFID are <strong>non-transferrable and non-refundable</strong>. Do not peel it off and transfer in other location or vehicle.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-500">Do's and Don'ts</h2>
        <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-green-600">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              Do's
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span>
                Maintain one (1) car length distance from the vehicle ahead
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span>
                Wait for the boom arm to fully lower before proceeding
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span>
                Keep your RFID sticker clean and intact
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span>
                Report any RFID issues to the guard house or SBDMC office
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span>
                Renew your RFID before the 1-year validity expires
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-red-600">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 14l2-2m0 0l2-2m-2 2l-2-2m2 2l2 2m7-2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              Don'ts
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
                Tailgate or follow closely behind another vehicle
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
                Peel off or transfer the RFID sticker to another vehicle
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
                Spray the RFID directly with a pressure washer
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
                Use abrasive substances on the RFID sticker
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
                Apply excessive force on the black chip at the middle of the RFID
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="rounded-xl border-2 border-red-300 bg-red-50 p-6 text-center">
        <div class="mb-3 flex justify-center">
          <svg class="h-10 w-10 text-red-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-2.5L13.732 4c-.77-.833-1.964-.833-2.732 0L4.082 16.5c-.77.833.192 2.5 1.732 2.5z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-red-700">Damages to Boom Arm</h3>
        <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-red-600">Will incur a PHP 15,000.00 penalty</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up">RFID Downloads</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up">
          <div class="mb-5 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary-500 text-white">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-primary-500">RFID Application Form</h3>
          <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-gray-500">Application form for RFID access passes — September 2022.</p>
          <a href="https://irp.cdn-website.com/33a8ffc6/files/uploaded/RFID_FORM_20220903.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-500 transition-all hover:text-primary-600">
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" /></svg>
            Download PDF
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <div class="mb-5 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary-500 text-white">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-primary-500">SOP: RFID Issuance</h3>
          <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-gray-500">Standard operating procedure for RFID issuance.</p>
          <a href="https://irp.cdn-website.com/33a8ffc6/files/uploaded/SOP+for+RFID.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-500 transition-all hover:text-primary-600">
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" /></svg>
            Download PDF
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll(".faq-toggle").forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener("click", () => {
      const answer = btn.nextElementSibling;
      const icon = btn.querySelector(".faq-icon");
      const isOpen = answer.classList.contains("max-h-96");
      document.querySelectorAll(".faq-answer").forEach((el) => {
        el.classList.remove("max-h-96");
        el.classList.add("max-h-0");
        el.previousElementSibling.querySelector(".faq-icon")?.classList.remove("rotate-45");
      });
      if (!isOpen) {
        answer.classList.remove("max-h-0");
        answer.classList.add("max-h-96");
        icon?.classList.add("rotate-45");
      }
    });
  });
</script>
